{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to battle for the title of top eatery? Yes, Chef!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just inherited your grandma\u2019s once-famous meatball restaurant in the cozy town of KuloNiku. Now it\u2019s up to you to bring it back to glory as the top eatery! Take on eccentric orders from townsfolk, serve delicious meals, and restore your family\u2019s legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware\u2014there\u2019s fierce competition from the town\u2019s flashiest rival: Souper Starz, run by the menacing rockstar chef, Stella!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/8f6415006baf00d7cb475c92d19f5ea1.avif?t=1767887030\" width=586 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/8d0f56ee07e33ca339c2e92581d44fd3.poster.avif?t=1767887030\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/8d0f56ee07e33ca339c2e92581d44fd3.webm?t=1767887030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/8d0f56ee07e33ca339c2e92581d44fd3.mp4?t=1767887030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to pour, sizzle, slice, and skewer! Cook juicy meatballs, fry up toppings, and prepare other delicious ingredients in your very own restaurant kitchen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop, boil, fry, torch, and more with immersive, tactile controls that make every action tickle your brain and make your mouth water.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to add an extra punch of garlic or a sprinkle of salt? Go for it. You\u2019re the chef \u2013 find multiple ways to prepare your customers the perfect dish and rack up those juicy tips! \ud83d\udcb0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your customers aren\u2019t just customers. Some may become your allies \u2764\ufe0f, rivals \u2694\ufe0f, or even part of your story \ud83d\udcd6.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/19e08959650a3c3e5b0fa1ac09d19d7e.avif?t=1767887030\" width=586 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/26fec0d470e71fc50d43726aea92b5a3.poster.avif?t=1767887030\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/26fec0d470e71fc50d43726aea92b5a3.webm?t=1767887030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/26fec0d470e71fc50d43726aea92b5a3.mp4?t=1767887030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rival chefs want the top spot, and there\u2019s only one way to settle things: Meatball Brawls!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these thrilling culinary duels, you\u2019ll go head-to-head to impress a panel of rotating judges. It\u2019s not just about speed - it\u2019s about strategy, creativity, and mastering every step of the cooking process.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play mini-games to impress both the judges and the crowd watching live, who will issue on-the-spot requests to boost your score!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/d98b1a4dd9f559707fa2190bf337484e.avif?t=1767887030\" width=586 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/0977e04ed0e5d4b29bfa53cb2f952e39.poster.avif?t=1767887030\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/0977e04ed0e5d4b29bfa53cb2f952e39.webm?t=1767887030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/0977e04ed0e5d4b29bfa53cb2f952e39.mp4?t=1767887030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep things fresh! Unlock new tools, purchase better ingredients, and discover brand-new recipes to keep your menu exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your restaurant with fun decorations in a variety of styles. Decor isn\u2019t just cosmetic; some items give gameplay perks to impress your customers.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3357960?t=1767887030","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/180a44930435aa6b5a2b901d903c91121500bcfd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767887030","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/851dbd4c5179002e67159077e9973a2d1f928e65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767887030","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/851dbd4c5179002e67159077e9973a2d1f928e65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767887030","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3732560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Try the Demo!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/bd256a32f745417e266d0bab3fea0441.avif?t=1767887030\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to battle for the title of top eatery? Yes, Chef!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just inherited your grandma\u2019s once-famous meatball restaurant in the cozy town of KuloNiku. Now it\u2019s up to you to bring it back to glory as the top eatery! Take on eccentric orders from townsfolk, serve delicious meals, and restore your family\u2019s legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware\u2014there\u2019s fierce competition from the town\u2019s flashiest rival: Souper Starz, run by the menacing rockstar chef, Stella!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/8f6415006baf00d7cb475c92d19f5ea1.avif?t=1767887030\" width=586 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/8d0f56ee07e33ca339c2e92581d44fd3.poster.avif?t=1767887030\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/8d0f56ee07e33ca339c2e92581d44fd3.webm?t=1767887030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/8d0f56ee07e33ca339c2e92581d44fd3.mp4?t=1767887030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to pour, sizzle, slice, and skewer! Cook juicy meatballs, fry up toppings, and prepare other delicious ingredients in your very own restaurant kitchen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop, boil, fry, torch, and more with immersive, tactile controls that make every action tickle your brain and make your mouth water.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to add an extra punch of garlic or a sprinkle of salt? Go for it. You\u2019re the chef \u2013 find multiple ways to prepare your customers the perfect dish and rack up those juicy tips! \ud83d\udcb0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your customers aren\u2019t just customers. Some may become your allies \u2764\ufe0f, rivals \u2694\ufe0f, or even part of your story \ud83d\udcd6.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/19e08959650a3c3e5b0fa1ac09d19d7e.avif?t=1767887030\" width=586 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/26fec0d470e71fc50d43726aea92b5a3.poster.avif?t=1767887030\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/26fec0d470e71fc50d43726aea92b5a3.webm?t=1767887030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/26fec0d470e71fc50d43726aea92b5a3.mp4?t=1767887030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rival chefs want the top spot, and there\u2019s only one way to settle things: Meatball Brawls!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these thrilling culinary duels, you\u2019ll go head-to-head to impress a panel of rotating judges. It\u2019s not just about speed - it\u2019s about strategy, creativity, and mastering every step of the cooking process.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play mini-games to impress both the judges and the crowd watching live, who will issue on-the-spot requests to boost your score!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/d98b1a4dd9f559707fa2190bf337484e.avif?t=1767887030\" width=586 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/0977e04ed0e5d4b29bfa53cb2f952e39.poster.avif?t=1767887030\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/0977e04ed0e5d4b29bfa53cb2f952e39.webm?t=1767887030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/0977e04ed0e5d4b29bfa53cb2f952e39.mp4?t=1767887030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep things fresh! Unlock new tools, purchase better ingredients, and discover brand-new recipes to keep your menu exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your restaurant with fun decorations in a variety of styles. Decor isn\u2019t just cosmetic; some items give gameplay perks to impress your customers.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Gambir Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/a2b150d5cf675ba865508d3c670ad89d3074bdbc/header.jpg?t=1767887030","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Lion<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 2000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Sonoma<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Slicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce 8800 gt<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3357960/465170321/0c1c9556ebe5ec9d4133e2c899ddb918cce9db68/1758581179/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758729767","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3357960/465170321/0c1c9556ebe5ec9d4133e2c899ddb918cce9db68/1758581179/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758729767","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3357960/465170321/0c1c9556ebe5ec9d4133e2c899ddb918cce9db68/1758581179/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758729767","id":257204314,"name":"Partnership Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204314/e49d8fbcaa2435087255d39abee2774b1763c6ec/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758729767"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3357960/985532303/a5913696e3a000c8e162bc7569f51ed7ccbf69d1/1750843373/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749726616","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3357960/985532303/a5913696e3a000c8e162bc7569f51ed7ccbf69d1/1750843373/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749726616","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3357960/985532303/a5913696e3a000c8e162bc7569f51ed7ccbf69d1/1750843373/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749726616","id":257155907,"name":"KuloNiku : Bowl Up! - Demo Trailer ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155907/7e46979ddb3f2e4a117dd30ced108a4c7dc3f925/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749726616"}],"name":"KuloNiku: Bowl Up!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce 1060 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> General<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Minimum 1280x720 screen resolution</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce 1070 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> General<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Minimum 1920x1080 screen resolution</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["Raw Fury"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cOverall, the game's focus on simplicity in the gameplay mechanics, along with a cutesy presentation, is solid groundwork for making it stand out in the indie landscape.\u201d<br>DualShockers - Preview<br><br>\u201cThe experience so far is the kind of wholesome, lighthearted experience that truly provides a world worth digging into, and hopefully the full game will be just as much of a hearty meal as it has the chance to be.\u201d<br>Hardcore Gamer - Preview<br><br>\u201cAlongside its exciting, fast-paced cooking gameplay, the game\u2019s lovingly realized anime-inspired visuals and pleasant characters have me excited to make some more goofy soups when it launches down the line.\u201d<br>Monstervine - Preview<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/16dd8e54d33dbf2a47b1b70cc8fd1fa695a41db9/ss_16dd8e54d33dbf2a47b1b70cc8fd1fa695a41db9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767887030","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/16dd8e54d33dbf2a47b1b70cc8fd1fa695a41db9/ss_16dd8e54d33dbf2a47b1b70cc8fd1fa695a41db9.600x338.jpg?t=1767887030"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/8f6728bec30c8789c12a306973e3c7bbc8dbef20/ss_8f6728bec30c8789c12a306973e3c7bbc8dbef20.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767887030","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/8f6728bec30c8789c12a306973e3c7bbc8dbef20/ss_8f6728bec30c8789c12a306973e3c7bbc8dbef20.600x338.jpg?t=1767887030"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/6313332e2d1d89fe301c69f45b5050ce04f81fca/ss_6313332e2d1d89fe301c69f45b5050ce04f81fca.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767887030","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/6313332e2d1d89fe301c69f45b5050ce04f81fca/ss_6313332e2d1d89fe301c69f45b5050ce04f81fca.600x338.jpg?t=1767887030"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/d38108f81989424957eadb810ca532bc500e484f/ss_d38108f81989424957eadb810ca532bc500e484f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767887030","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/d38108f81989424957eadb810ca532bc500e484f/ss_d38108f81989424957eadb810ca532bc500e484f.600x338.jpg?t=1767887030"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/f834d0d945f58b5eb51869f31f1f9a81787cd85f/ss_f834d0d945f58b5eb51869f31f1f9a81787cd85f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767887030","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/f834d0d945f58b5eb51869f31f1f9a81787cd85f/ss_f834d0d945f58b5eb51869f31f1f9a81787cd85f.600x338.jpg?t=1767887030"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/9d01eef27e5d75962aae2c27340f98fdb5950aad/ss_9d01eef27e5d75962aae2c27340f98fdb5950aad.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767887030","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/9d01eef27e5d75962aae2c27340f98fdb5950aad/ss_9d01eef27e5d75962aae2c27340f98fdb5950aad.600x338.jpg?t=1767887030"}],"short_description":"Prep your stations for a management-sim cooking game with attitude! Utilize long-honed recipes as you prepare unique meals for quirky small-town locals, upgrade and customize your shop, compete in thrilling cooking battles to become top chef, and protect your family\u2019s long-running restaurant!","steam_appid":3357960,"support_info":{"email":"halo@gambirstudio.com","url":"https://gambirstudio.com"},"supported_languages":"English, Indonesian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Traditional Chinese, French, German, Portuguese - Brazil","type":"game","website":"https://gambirstudio.com/presskitkuloniku/"}